/// recorded-conditional here, never waived).
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. The tsc leg additionally needs
/// CAN_TSC with CAN_BUN. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A
/// identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: DELEGATE-007 (staged runtime/checks.test.ts).
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23, QN1).
/// Case bundled/main-fixture checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, positive-green, zero-fails, failure-reason, recovered-sign,
/// empty-reason, run-silent, traces-green, tsc-gated.
/// Facet map (checks_test.go legs): traces-green pins the staged offline
/// traces (L29-34: "5 pass" and "0 fail"); assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L80-83: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L84-87: passed true, 7 assertions); positive-green/zero-fails/
/// failure-reason pin require_positive (main.can L4-12: 3 => ok, 0/-1 =>
/// failed "expected a positive value" pinned verbatim); recovered-sign
/// pins recovered_sign (L13-22: 3 => true, 0 => false); empty-reason pins
/// empty_reason (L23-29: sample yields ""); run-silent pins the run leg
/// (L88-91: exit 0, empty stdout, empty stderr); tsc-gated pins the
/// strict-tsc leg as conditional on CAN_TSC with CAN_BUN (L92-111;
/// BLOCKED in this session, recorded here, never waived).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
